---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | RentLocalMachinery" description="How RentLocalMachinery collects and uses information you submit in a quote request.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4 px-4 py-10 text-slate-700">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: November 2026. This is a general template; have a lawyer review it before relying on it.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you request a quote we collect your name, phone number, email address, delivery ZIP code, project start date, estimated rental duration and the equipment and city you selected. We also record when you agreed to be contacted.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use this information to contact equipment rental suppliers on your behalf, to share your request with suppliers who may offer you a quote, and to contact you about your request by phone, text or email.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>We share your request details with independent equipment rental suppliers so they can respond to you. We do not sell your information for unrelated advertising.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to stop contacting you or to delete your request at any time by replying to any message from us with "STOP" or by emailing us at the address on this site. Suppliers have their own privacy practices.</p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site does not use advertising cookies. Basic technical logs may be kept for security and troubleshooting.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
